cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: livestock-health-vision
abstract: >-
  The spine from farm video to auditable per-animal health events: detection,
  tracking, identity anchoring, phenotype extraction, a baseline per animal,
  calibrated risk scores and alerts with an evidence clip. First target: dairy
  cattle lameness at a parlour or AMS exit lane, filmed with one RGB camera.
  Every event it currently emits is marked stub_derived and non_clinical.
authors:
